<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>For Livpia ❤️</title>

<style>

/* ==============================
   DASAR
================================ */

* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
}

html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;

    background:
        radial-gradient(
            circle at 50% 35%,
            #4b1025 0%,
            #260711 45%,
            #090107 100%
        );

    color: white;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
}


/* ==============================
   CAHAYA DI BELAKANG BUNGA
================================ */

.glow {
    position: fixed;

    width: 330px;
    height: 330px;

    left: 50%;
    top: 36%;

    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);

    border-radius: 50%;

    background: rgba(255, 57, 105, 0.22);

    filter: blur(60px);

    animation: glowPulse 4s ease-in-out infinite;

    pointer-events: none;
}

@keyframes glowPulse {

    0%, 100% {
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(.85);
        opacity: .55;
    }

    50% {
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.15);
        opacity: .95;
    }
}


/* ==============================
   HALAMAN UTAMA
================================ */

.page {
    min-height: 100vh;

    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;

    align-items: center;

    position: relative;

    padding-top: 35px;
}


/* ==============================
   BUNGA
================================ */

.flower-area {

    position: relative;

    width: 280px;
    height: 440px;

    display: flex;

    justify-content: center;
}


/* batang */

.stem {

    position: absolute;

    top: 190px;

    left: 50%;

    width: 8px;
    height: 220px;

    transform: translateX(-50%) scaleY(0);

    transform-origin: top;

    border-radius: 10px;

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            to right,
            #123d17,
            #4d9d4f,
            #1b531f
        );

    animation:
        growStem 2s ease forwards;

    animation-delay: .5s;

    z-index: 1;
}

@keyframes growStem {

    to {
        transform:
            translateX(-50%)
            scaleY(1);
    }
}


/* ==============================
   DAUN
================================ */

.leaf {

    position: absolute;

    width: 75px;
    height: 38px;

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            #6bb66a,
            #1b5a22
        );

    border-radius:
        100% 0 100% 0;

    opacity: 0;

    z-index: 2;
}

.leaf-left {

    top: 310px;
    left: 55px;

    transform:
        rotate(-30deg)
        scale(0);

    animation:
        leafAppear 1s ease forwards;

    animation-delay: 2.1s;
}

.leaf-right {

    top: 350px;
    right: 55px;

    transform:
        rotate(145deg)
        scale(0);

    animation:
        leafAppear 1s ease forwards;

    animation-delay: 2.4s;
}

@keyframes leafAppear {

    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform:
            rotate(-30deg)
            scale(1);
    }
}


/* ==============================
   ROSE
================================ */

.rose {

    position: absolute;

    top: 15px;

    left: 50%;

    width: 230px;
    height: 230px;

    transform:
        translateX(-50%)
        scale(.08);

    animation:
        roseBloom 4.5s
        cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)
        forwards;

    z-index: 10;
}

@keyframes roseBloom {

    0% {
        transform:
            translateX(-50%)
            scale(.08)
            rotate(-8deg);
    }

    40% {
        transform:
            translateX(-50%)
            scale(.55)
            rotate(4deg);
    }

    70% {
        transform:
            translateX(-50%)
            scale(1.08)
            rotate(-2deg);
    }

    85% {
        transform:
            translateX(-50%)
            scale(.97)
            rotate(1deg);
    }

    100% {
        transform:
            translateX(-50%)
            scale(1)
            rotate(0);
    }
}


/* semua kelopak */

.petal {

    position: absolute;

    left: 50%;
    top: 50%;

    width: 92px;
    height: 125px;

    transform-origin:
        50% 90%;

    border-radius:
        70% 30% 70% 30%;

    background:
        radial-gradient(
            circle at 35% 25%,
            #ffb4c5 0%,
            #f0446c 42%,
            #a50d39 82%,
            #68051f 100%
        );

    box-shadow:
        inset
        -9px
        -14px
        17px
        rgba(65,0,22,.4);

    margin-left: -46px;
    margin-top: -105px;

    transition:
        transform 1s ease;
}


/* susunan kelopak luar */

.petal:nth-child(1) {
    transform:
        rotate(0deg)
        translateY(-38px);
}

.petal:nth-child(2) {
    transform:
        rotate(45deg)
        translateY(-38px);
}

.petal:nth-child(3) {
    transform:
        rotate(90deg)
        translateY(-38px);
}

.petal:nth-child(4) {
    transform:
        rotate(135deg)
        translateY(-38px);
}

.petal:nth-child(5) {
    transform:
        rotate(180deg)
        translateY(-38px);
}

.petal:nth-child(6) {
    transform:
        rotate(225deg)
        translateY(-38px);
}

.petal:nth-child(7) {
    transform:
        rotate(270deg)
        translateY(-38px);
}

.petal:nth-child(8) {
    transform:
        rotate(315deg)
        translateY(-38px);
}


/* kelopak bagian dalam */

.inner-rose {

    position: absolute;

    left: 50%;
    top: 50%;

    width: 115px;
    height: 135px;

    transform:
        translate(-50%, -50%)
        rotate(12deg);

    border-radius:
        65% 35% 60% 40%;

    background:
        radial-gradient(
            circle at 35% 25%,
            #ffb5c5,
            #e63160 48%,
            #89072d 100%
        );

    box-shadow:
        inset
        -10px
        -13px
        18px
        rgba(70,0,25,.45);

    z-index: 15;
}


/* kelopak tengah */

.inner-rose::before {

    content: "";

    position: absolute;

    width: 82px;
    height: 108px;

    left: 16px;
    top: 10px;

    border-radius:
        60% 40% 60% 40%;

    background:
        radial-gradient(
            circle at 35% 25%,
            #ffbdca,
            #d51d4e 60%,
            #79062a
        );

    transform:
        rotate(-20deg);
}


/* pusat mawar */

.inner-rose::after {

    content: "";

    position: absolute;

    width: 42px;
    height: 70px;

    left: 37px;
    top: 28px;

    border-radius:
        70% 30% 65% 35%;

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            #ff9db2,
            #a30935
        );

    transform:
        rotate(20deg);

    box-shadow:
        inset
        -7px
        -7px
        10px
        rgba(60,0,20,.35);
}


/* ==============================
   NAMA
================================ */

.name {

    position: absolute;

    top: 122px;

    width: 100%;

    text-align: center;

    z-index: 30;

    font-size: 34px;

    font-weight: bold;

    color: #fff7fa;

    text-shadow:
        0 0 5px white,
        0 0 15px #ff5d85,
        0 0 30px #ff1f59;

    opacity: 0;

    animation:
        nameAppear 1.8s ease forwards;

    animation-delay: 4.2s;
}

@keyframes nameAppear {

    from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: scale(.5);
    }

    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: scale(1);
    }
}


/* ==============================
   PESAN PAGI
================================ */

.message {

    width: min(92%, 720px);

    margin-top: -5px;

    padding:
        28px
        24px
        32px;

    border-radius: 25px;

    background:
        rgba(255,255,255,.07);

    border:
        1px solid
        rgba(255,180,200,.16);

    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);

    box-shadow:
        0 15px 45px
        rgba(0,0,0,.25);

    opacity: 0;

    animation:
        messageAppear 1.5s ease forwards;

    animation-delay: 5s;

    position: relative;

    z-index: 20;
}

.message h2 {

    text-align: center;

    font-size: 27px;

    color: #ffd8e2;

    margin-bottom: 18px;

    text-shadow:
        0 0 12px
        rgba(255,100,140,.5);
}

.message p {

    font-family:
        Arial,
        sans-serif;

    font-size: 14px;

    line-height: 1.9;

    color: #f2dce2;

    text-align: left;
}

.message p + p {
    margin-top: 14px;
}

@keyframes messageAppear {

    from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(30px);
    }

    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
    }
}


/* ==============================
   HATI MELAYANG
================================ */

.heart {

    position: fixed;

    bottom: -30px;

    color: #ff6689;

    font-size: 18px;

    opacity: 0;

    pointer-events: none;

    z-index: 5;

    animation:
        heartFloat
        linear
        infinite;
}

.heart:nth-of-type(1) {
    left: 12%;
    animation-duration: 7s;
    animation-delay: 1s;
}

.heart:nth-of-type(2) {
    left: 30%;
    animation-duration: 9s;
    animation-delay: 3s;
}

.heart:nth-of-type(3) {
    left: 70%;
    animation-duration: 8s;
    animation-delay: 2s;
}

.heart:nth-of-type(4) {
    left: 88%;
    animation-duration: 10s;
    animation-delay: 4s;
}

@keyframes heartFloat {

    0% {
        transform:
            translateY(0)
            scale(.5)
            rotate(0);

        opacity: 0;
    }

    15% {
        opacity: .8;
    }

    100% {
        transform:
            translateY(-110vh)
            scale(1.3)
            rotate(25deg);

        opacity: 0;
    }
}


/* ==============================
   BINTANG / PARTIKEL
================================ */

.sparkle {

    position: fixed;

    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;

    border-radius: 50%;

    background: #ffd9e3;

    box-shadow:
        0 0 8px #ff9db5;

    opacity: .5;

    animation:
        sparkle 3s
        ease-in-out
        infinite;

    pointer-events: none;
}

.s1 {
    top: 15%;
    left: 15%;
}

.s2 {
    top: 25%;
    right: 15%;
    animation-delay: 1s;
}

.s3 {
    top: 60%;
    left: 8%;
    animation-delay: 2s;
}

.s4 {
    top: 65%;
    right: 10%;
    animation-delay: 1.5s;
}

@keyframes sparkle {

    0%,100% {
        opacity: .15;
        transform: scale(.6);
    }

    50% {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: scale(1.5);
    }
}


/* ==============================
   HP
================================ */

@media (max-width: 480px) {

    .flower-area {
        transform: scale(.84);
        transform-origin: top center;
        margin-bottom: -55px;
    }

    .message {
        width: 92%;
        padding: 23px 18px 27px;
    }

    .message h2 {
        font-size: 23px;
    }

    .message p {
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .name {
        font-size: 30px;
    }
}


/* ==============================
   HP KECIL
================================ */

@media (max-width: 360px) {

    .flower-area {
        transform: scale(.72);
        margin-bottom: -95px;
    }

    .message {
        width: 94%;
    }

    .message p {
        font-size: 12px;
    }
}

</style>
</head>


<body>

<!-- cahaya -->
<div class="glow"></div>


<!-- partikel -->
<div class="sparkle s1"></div>
<div class="sparkle s2"></div>
<div class="sparkle s3"></div>
<div class="sparkle s4"></div>


<div class="page">


    <!-- ==========================
         BUNGA
    =========================== -->

    <div class="flower-area">

        <div class="rose">

            <div class="petal"></div>
            <div class="petal"></div>
            <div class="petal"></div>
            <div class="petal"></div>
            <div class="petal"></div>
            <div class="petal"></div>
            <div class="petal"></div>
            <div class="petal"></div>

            <div class="inner-rose"></div>

        </div>


        <!-- nama -->
        <div class="name">
            Livpia ❤️
        </div>


        <!-- batang -->
        <div class="stem"></div>


        <!-- daun -->
        <div class="leaf leaf-left"></div>
        <div class="leaf leaf-right"></div>

    </div>



    <!-- ==========================
         PESAN PAGI
    =========================== -->

    <section class="message">

        <h2>
            Selamat pagi, sayangku! ☀️✨
        </h2>

        <p>
            Semoga pagimu dibuka dengan senyuman dan udara segar
            yang bikin hati adem. Bangunnya perlahan saja,
            tidak usah terburu-buru. Tarik napas dalam-dalam,
            rasakan hangatnya mentari pagi ini, dan ingat kalau
            di sini ada aku yang selalu memikirkan kamu dan
            mendoakan yang terbaik buat harimu.
        </p>

        <p>
            Semoga semua urusan dan kegiatanmu hari ini berjalan
            lancar, dimudahkan, dan dikelilingi oleh hal-hal baik
            serta orang-orang yang bikin kamu nyaman. Tetap semangat,
            jaga kesehatan, dan jangan lupa sarapan ya supaya energi
            kamu penuh buat menjalani hari.
        </p>

        <p>
            Kalau nanti di tengah hari kamu merasa lelah atau pusing,
            ingat ya kalau kamu tidak sendirian. Aku selalu ada di sini,
            siap jadi tempat kamu cerita, mengeluh, atau sekadar
            melepas penat.
        </p>

        <p>
            Selamat beraktivitas, sayang! ❤️
            <br>
            <strong>Have a wonderful and amazing day! 🌷</strong>
        </p>

    </section>


</div>


<!-- ==========================
     HATI
=========================== -->

<div class="heart">♥</div>
<div class="heart">♡</div>
<div class="heart">♥</div>
<div class="heart">♡</div>


</body>
</html>
